od toxicity directly. Implementing that mechanism and its dependency validation belongs in this development handoff, not an invented sequence of unrelated activities or an era unlock.\\\\nCosts and progress: assess and inspect each cost one round and 0.2 energy. Each accepted hands-on assay step costs one active round and 0.5 energy; longer timed operations and equipment energy follow the locked recipe and must be included in a pre-run quote. Incubation/extraction time advances only through actual simulation rounds, with a declared conversion to method time; development or review waiting advances nothing. Reject an unquotable or unschedulable recipe before charging or reserving inputs. Show exact expected active rounds, elapsed rounds, energy, consumables and destructive sample mass before the applicant separately starts. Record completed steps, actual quantities, timestamps, instrument/calibration IDs and next deadlines; charge only performed work. No automatic testing, acquisition or communication. Other participants, if any, must communicate and perform their own actions independently.\\\\nConservation: reserve only the authorized sample portion and consumables, retain original provenance and ordinary decay, and subtract actual weighed material without inventing a unit-to-gram conversion. If calibrated splitting is not supported, require the whole item and report the destruction involved. Homogenate, shell if removed, retained food, spent extract, used assay and solvent waste remain explicit material outputs; aliquots cannot be duplicated and used analytical material cannot be returned as clean food. Reagent volumes and evaporation or transfers require corresponding material accounting. Assay results neither restore nutrition nor remove toxins. The untested remainder, if any, retains its prior state; no measured concentration is assigned to it automatically.\\\\nInterruption, cancellation and death stop hands-on work and release unused reservations once; spent sample, energy, reagents and elapsed time are never refunded. Resume only from logged steps whose contamination, storage and timing conditions remain valid. A missed read window or failed control produces invalid/inconclusive output and a new attempt requires new consumed inputs. Timed chemical processes and ordinary spoilage continue while the world actually advances, even if the actor stops; they do not continue during review waiting. Death cancels the active assignment without resurrecting inputs or automatically disposing of hazards. Leave labeled materials, waste and equipment in their real locations. No autonomous repeat assays or ongoing benefit. Maintain tools by required cleaning and calibration checks; damaged, contaminated or expired equipment/reagents fail prerequisite checks.\\\\nResult scope: a valid result reports only the named analyte sum in the analyzed homogenate, with method, units, uncertainty/range, controls and sample provenance. Below detection means not detected at that method's limit, not absent. Out-of-range and invalid controls must be explicit. A single nut is not a representative batch sample. Results do not establish absence of other toxins, allergens, microbes, rancidity or nutritional inadequacy, general edibility, a necessary preparation, successful detoxification or health improvement. No roasting/treatment recommendation follows without separate validated evidence. The current assessment must conclude that none of those dietary properties has yet been measured.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":5,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Lin must individually study for 5 active rounds at 0.5 energy per completed round; record progress, pause/resume it, and do not refund completed study. Study does not supply tools, evidence, consent or mastery in advance. Requests, registration, assessment checklists, missing-resource reports and learning grant no pleasure or satisfaction. A completed assay may qualify only for a personally applicable, genuinely verified information gain; a failed assay qualifies only if controls or observations actually establish a new bounded fact, not merely because it failed. If using the existing experience system, deduplicate by sample provenance, analyte, method and materially changed evidence; cap any eligible event at 0.2 short pleasure, at most once per 10 actual rounds, decaying to zero within 10 rounds, and at most 0.04 maintained satisfaction gain per eligible round with the existing 0.002 decay and existing account cap. Repeated equivalent readings cannot farm novelty rewards. These are event eligibility bounds, not permission to alter protected reward accounts, budgets, goals or permissions; if the existing protected interface cannot express them, issue no reward. No nutrition, health or physical-comfort benefit is granted.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit observable assessment, step-start, material-transfer, timed-process, control-read, invalidation, cancellation and completed-result events only when those actions actually occur. Reusable visual metadata should include capability/mode, actor and target IDs, method reference, stage, progress, elapsed/deadline rounds, equipment/material IDs, location and status (requirements-missing, ready, active, paused, invalid, cancelled or result-available). Show real tools, sample preparation, containers and waste only when present. Any assay coloration or reader indication requires a modeled physical response and appropriate visibility; an assessment cannot display a completed test. Display result provenance, limits and invalid/inconclusive states alongside readings. No green safe-to-eat badge, treatment-success animation, imagined laboratory, toxin visualization, mastery effect or reward celebration for incomplete or failed work.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

