iagnostic variants of the same activity. The smallest executable version is minimal in mechanism, not narrow in scope.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_05281c5186fe0d91016b08fc2418c887d1ad357bfd8388315e","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABrCPwkL2lmvs_5FDFQUmeOoCDnNvqIecTWImDcnPlYmgjZG_FzWAIxYiO9N9f7_H62Rph-urpt3IKclJOhPNtMWLzYbiZe46p29Znol9fsbUZN05-DKIysZO7ap4BHhVfxOzlWyRFBvFx-nI5Za7HJQnD504z7ezNIKBCf3FVa-h-ETI-UmS5NwybbZNHgVHAqdi-lxuO7j3x7uOO1suxSrAGvvZkBDUohZU2yn-XUlj3OXKR5O8SXQIclKzxoYDpiJgbNVr6HWwrRMW-7_MqWjJWoSyjKx9fvPO2jO_dXzbnNNBg6t7xoTvzV071GNn88XAAq_pab3bP0kxBS1j59XH9pJ27ZiJTg0pHz3fNlMXAj8Lp8qr6zVZ_HkaHSLm5aTgb8arOjMZJhQQeqf3S-7AHEgpF-Gqf59utO25Ufy6JQ-rUpFA9X3jwGbDzaIV1wkSoc1VVdZqmWsAljSUW99Souklz29LVf4rbdXt0uBqDPX7cnJHi6VLcEP5AWL3L1TlUhiOKcwER0OK7t_-T9dTJV4_vi9G3w9eqTXwI_xGLI2ElbKUgpGnzaZK3-M0CHY8eDlNmWwuEmHf5hDXD6t-GNUNdtis9WpRqn6e9Q0taD2FIv9wZW7wyvmXZ6jGcmYmEIIdkq6RUs7J9dpRjiC8BqJbJuMJ3Xy2mbBDatv8iSWn1YeOAAIrzZDwYxT3cNQ8b76hGyvJqvKeFnuDk43EVvU48iir94hfEgD222sC0ae5yceyV8Y7vkbpf2MTeWFnyBf4zcgSysqzSrfM58Ph92Bf8jOP1eWT5PNWhKqptj4OKVnP3HPLhkTmsFqDjlY5-Z_22zQ4z3mEv5iKP9VTHXnrKGKi1MDpD3DFpvSoHFMPfmpev6KPbA3yFKuhwKb44DdIEmN1WLfAcZjO_vDlSZFQdBbx7NB5cfXGWL0nJnEZyksKAQoCqBNs0O_ud4sw2nvBeEUwCoZ0ssTSgwB9hSkDDHnNJ0KRdQL9pxsm1BoReRA5pmkCh2Rj2OngvHZbKMU_vu92z9NtFBSkUCLmZwSVVAGyT9tHSayHaGC-G81p3fLq-uBclEwOtsHnUPZ8U1FueCKiqsaIY7LUr0eXhS5ffP6ak2z8R7AX7e2kIUDO_7MhpBy5T4CrzyuAFxW2rPFTCSoK3cCi07LXnAVEFlEKkLmoCfMK5_5M9nN_UR47cgSkx-M-NcPQQODN4_EtpO-XVeZSDwMY_rmSwKrkx2sE4ZLUYmYBnwGE6ay-HYVT0a4go9urOa50kz4-RzL8L6WGuURoqRyG4gzLA-ozgHGURmr_T27QezjqbfvOI_NNtOdVdlJIR9f7CiXZmZt4-HjPhwX-RDgVV6dz_NNhms0vBWKa1h-mB2SrtF7GO1qZ6uFjLtjrJgQ_eFjR_MFEgswTjk4Dmy-yJTpM9vQPGrx6SrVJkNiQUjuNY1sE-gSBgCmevDiE0xR1FBa4xu8-sS1Nfi2ydYkpZcKUu5Ni4wgLI2z5veGxbxcRUPzzaMg2-S3YiWUv0By_tcQUPySCfRyTRuIA8pVeoQL3hsdzYkcqxOO8iATqR4L3cNM2SPoabNbtFnJwT6Mae8wlVpjl0rbg4L4RnQi8xLbZjRo3b2MBEk_UeVoigIaVGO5jXT7crnTP4ArQgj4C1mMZssWLMTdrHlKWQ5lACWqzCvTKDqxZtVGvdRrOd3vAt-lMDeW1c_y5oK0rjXctCcehtdEtu6-U